# REPEAT (#7): a song bar plays 1-8 times (the SONG screen's second page, KNOB 4). Bar 1 x3 (P1),
# bar 2 (P2) (songpos and ppat count from 1): the song plays P1 three bars, then P2, then loops.
wait 300
tapkey w0
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 6
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
expect songlen 2
turn K1 -5
turn SELECT 1
turn K4 2
expect songbar1.0 1
tap SEL
turn SELECT 7
turn ALGO 1
tap HOME
expect songon 1
turn K1 -5
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect songpos 1
wait 1920
expect songpos 1
wait 1920
expect songpos 1
wait 1920
expect songpos 2
expect ppat0 2
wait 1920
expect songpos 1
expect ppat0 1
